    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kinumunumae ŋasuban a Paska",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Esekia kiyakiya ŋituŋa Isirael ka Yudaya, kigir daŋ ŋabaruwae neni a ŋituŋa a Epuraim ka Manase, anyaraun ikes potu Kai ke Ekapolon Yerusalem kinumunuma ŋasuban ŋuna a Paska aŋuna ke Ekapolon Akuj a Ŋisirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋun aŋuna keponiata erwosit ka ŋikapolok ta ŋituŋa daadaŋ alo Yerusalem tocamut akinumunum ŋasuban ŋuna a Paska elap ŋolo a ŋiarei, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(anerae pa apedorito ikes akinumunum apaki ŋina sek amaikina kinumunumere, anerae akudyoko ŋisacaradotin ŋulu kitaleuno ka amam ŋituŋa apotu tocunakin Yerusalem). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu ayeunet ŋin totakan erae ŋina eyookino aneni ke erwosit ka alotuŋa a daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ikes totubut atemar kiserakinae ŋakiro ŋun neni a Ŋisirael daadaŋ ŋinapei alo Beeriseba tari Dan, tonyaraunae ŋituŋa potu Yerusalem kinumunuma ŋasuban ŋuna a Paska aŋuna ke Ekapolon Akuj a Ŋisirael, anerae alopite a ŋolo egiritere ŋakiro a ŋasuban a ŋun, kekudyoko ŋituŋa ŋulu aponeneete akinumunum ŋasuban ŋun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Analimunet ke erwosit ka ŋikapolok, apotu ŋituŋa ŋulu eyakitae toloto Isirael daadaŋ ka Yudaya daadaŋ, yaasi ŋabaruwae ŋuna egiritae ŋakiro nu, “Okoe Ŋisirael, toboŋutu neni ke Ekapolon Akuj ka Aburaam, a Isaka ka Isirael, ikotere Akuj ebuni neni kus a ŋulu idoŋito, a ŋulu ipotu toiunos anapedor a ŋirwosi a ŋulu ka Asiriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyikwaanikinosi ka atapapaa kus ka ŋiyeneta kus ŋulu apotu tojoŋoto akikinyomit neni ke Ekapolon Akuj atapapaa kec, ido abu Akuj kituruwo ikes ŋulu ikiinakinete aumokin lopite ŋolo iteoto iyes tokona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyitogogoŋo tokona ŋakyes kus lopite ŋolo etogogoŋitotor atapapaa kus, nai inakinos neni ke Ekapolon, potu nakibois keŋ ŋina asegan, ŋina adau iŋes akitaleun ŋikaru ka ŋikaru, ido kitiyanakis Ekapolon Akuj kus, ikotere elemari iŋes aŋoit keŋ ŋina aryenyaanan aneni kus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani kiboŋut iyes neni ke Ekapolon, epedorete nai ŋulu erikorito ŋikaitotoi ka ŋidwe kus akisyon ikes kitoboŋut nakwap na, anerae ejok ka isyoniono Ekapolon Akuj kus, nyikimyekini iŋes iyes erae kiboŋut iyes neni keŋ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu ŋituŋa ŋulu eyakitae akiya ŋabaruwae toloto ageun alotaun ke epei tari ŋoloce anakwap a ŋina a ekabila a Epuraim ka a ŋina a ekabila a Manase, todolo tari lokabila a Sebulun; nai apotu ŋituŋa a ŋakiboisyo a ŋun tokyanatar ka tojamuwasi ŋakiro kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari ŋina aponiata ikes kitiyata ŋun, apotu ŋituŋa ŋidikudyo ŋulu a ekabila ka Aser, a Manase ka Sebulon kitiditeunos make, toloto Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alo Yudaya daŋ, abu Akuj inak ŋituŋa acamun ke epeitau anakimorikina akitiya ŋuna alimunito erwosit ka ŋikapolok anakirot a ŋina ke Ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa ŋulu alalak tocununos Yerusalem elap ŋolo a ŋiarei akinumunum ŋasuban ŋuna a ŋamugati a ŋuna emam ŋakinyalet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ikes kisyakis etic, tolemasi ŋamuroeta ŋuna ayakasi Yerusalem, kielasi ŋamuroeta daadaŋ ŋuna ecunyere ekinyate, kimasakis nayonae Kidiron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edoli ŋirwa ke elap ŋitomon ka ŋiomwon, elap ŋolo a ŋiarei, toara ikes ikale ŋini a Paska. Kiruma ŋileec ŋisacaradotin ka ŋilepi, aŋun, apotu kitaleun ka yaut Kai ke Ekapolon ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tosodo nai kibaka lopite ŋolo elimunitere alotooma Ŋikisila a Moses a ŋolo arae ituŋanan ŋini ka Akuj. Inakis nai ŋilepi ŋisacaradotin ŋaokot a ŋamuronisya, towuatakis ŋisacaradotin Namuroet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋuna akudyokyoto alotuŋa a ŋulu acunakina ŋituŋa ŋulu etaleuno, apotu ŋilepi toara ŋikaalei ŋulu a Paska aŋuna a ŋituŋa a ŋulu pa etaleuno, ido inakis neni ke Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari daŋ ŋina alalaata ŋituŋa ŋulu aponito alokabila a Epuraim, a Manase, a Isakar ka Sebulon ŋulu pa etaleuno, ido apotu tonyama akiriŋ a ŋikaalei a Paska, nyiwuapa ŋuna egiritae, abu Esekia kilip aŋuna kec tema, “Elipi ayoŋ Ekapolon ŋolo ejok kisyoni ikes daadaŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋulu einakinosi alotai kec akiwarit ŋuna ka Akuj Ekapolon a ŋina erae Akuj atapapaa kec, tari daŋ pa kitaleuno ikes lopite ŋolo elimunitotor ŋikisila ŋulu ka akibois a ŋina asegan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Ekapolon kiira ŋakiro ke Esekia, kisyoni ŋituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai Ŋisirael ŋulu acunakina Yerusalem torubakis ŋirwa ŋikanikaarei itiyaete ŋasuban ŋuna a ŋamugati a ŋuna emam ŋakinyalet, tolelyana nooi, ido aeosi a ŋinakoloŋit ŋilepi ka ŋisacaradotin isitiyaete ŋiboro ŋulu eore neni ke Ekapolon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirwor Esekia neni a ŋilepi a daadaŋ ŋakiro ŋuna esimukekinak nooi, anerae etoodiunito ŋilepi ayenut kec nooi etic ŋolo ke Ekapolon. Apotu ŋilepi kimuja ŋirwa ŋikanikaarei ŋinerin a ŋibaren ŋulu ainakinitae ikes, inanakis ŋainakineta ŋuna ke ekisil ka kipuro Ekapolon Akuj atapapaa kec eosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu nai ŋituŋa daadaŋ tocamut akitiya ŋirwa ŋice ŋikanikaarei ŋasuban ŋun, aŋun, apotu torubakis itiyaete ka alelyanu ŋirwa ŋikanikaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋirwa ŋul kitiyakin, anerae abu erwosit Esekia ŋolo a Yudaya inak ŋituŋa ŋimoŋin aliput ka ŋamesekin ŋalipyo ŋakanikaarei aŋuna a ŋainakineta, apotu ŋikapolok daŋ inakis ŋituŋa ŋimoŋin aliput ka ŋimesekin ŋalipyo ŋatomon. Apotu ŋisacaradotin ŋulu alalak nooi kitaleunos. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa a Yudaya daadaŋ: Ŋisacaradotin, ŋilepi, kaapei ka ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu aponito alo Isirael ka ŋituŋa ŋulugelaanotin ŋulu aponito alo Isirael ta ŋulugelaanotin ŋulu eboiyete alo Yudaya tolelyana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu alelyanu ŋina apolon nooi toyakaun Yerusalem, anerae ŋinapei alorwa a Solomon alokoku a Daudi a ŋolo arae erwosit a Ŋisirael, mam alelyanu abu toyakaun Yerusalem ŋina ekoni ŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.26"
            ]
